      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ffb3dc5191fd09ee9725",
      "document_start": 380,
      "document_end": 391,
      "text": "# 3.气压式平衡机;",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1b7d836c3ebdc6a9b2e7",
      "document_start": 392,
      "document_end": 424,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_65fb02ec30b5f1d2b808",
      "document_start": 426,
      "document_end": 445,
      "text": "气压式平衡机的特点是结构紧凑，质量小。",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a49828d5cb885f4a47e3",
      "document_start": 445,
      "document_end": 485,
      "text": "缺点是平衡力矩易受环境温度的影响，因而气压式平衡机通常需要设置温度调节或补偿器。",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_39f48e4c720fd1cb8858",
      "document_start": 485,
      "document_end": 509,
      "text": "温度补偿的方法有：调压力法、调容积法和调力臂法。",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ac2544f34100fb846606",
      "document_start": 509,
      "document_end": 604,
      "text": "其中，调容积法需要在平衡机的外部增设一个调节容积的装置，通常是一个可移动的活塞，当环境温度改变超过一定范围时，驱动活塞移动，即可改变平衡机的容积，从而调节气体压力，使得平衡力矩满足工作要求；",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3ed652dbe93ab91e1fad",
      "document_start": 604,
      "document_end": 641,
      "text": "调压力法需要设置高压气源或液压源，通过进、排气（或液体）调节平衡机的气压；",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a0ded5a5d509ec023536",
      "document_start": 641,
      "document_end": 684,
      "text": "调力臂法则是通过上（或下）支点的位置调整，从而改变平衡力的力臂，对温度的影响进行补偿。",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_805ad25820a6fa061344",
      "document_start": 686,
      "document_end": 706,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
