      "document_start": 1107,
      "document_end": 1144,
      "text": "当两支点间的距离增大，螺筒推动回转部分转动时，前止推轴承起减小摩擦的作用；",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a6dee808a9be4aad4acc",
      "document_start": 1144,
      "document_end": 1176,
      "text": "当距离缩小，螺筒拉动回转部分转动时，后止推轴承起减小摩擦的作用。",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3dd89ab7049002c350ca",
      "document_start": 1178,
      "document_end": 1198,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b4312b029c9753c8ba43",
      "document_start": 1199,
      "document_end": 1203,
      "text": "# 2.",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9df7d77bca980f666bfc",
      "document_start": 1204,
      "document_end": 1208,
      "text": "运动体;",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a1c4907a040bee8cccf0",
      "document_start": 1209,
      "document_end": 1241,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8c913ae66aa396808e26",
      "document_start": 1243,
      "document_end": 1279,
      "text": "扭杆：受扭转作用时，可产生扭转变形，以便吸收车轮与地面碰撞时的冲击能量。",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9246ac79ea2c83c280ea",
      "document_start": 1279,
      "document_end": 1305,
      "text": "它装在半轴内，内端有41条刻纹与半轴内端的刻纹啮合；",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_21e2540696408031933c",
      "document_start": 1305,
      "document_end": 1324,
      "text": "外端有40条刻纹，与扭杆盖的刻纹啮合。",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_de630faf35d2b2a1749a",
      "document_start": 1324,
      "document_end": 1334,
      "text": "扭杆盖固定在曲臂上。",
      "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89"
    }
  ],
