          "document_end": 1241,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89",
          "start": 1209,
          "end": 1241,
          "chunk_start": 1209,
          "chunk_end": 1241,
          "sentence_document_start": 1209,
          "sentence_document_end": 1241,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_8c913ae66aa396808e26",
          "document_start": 1243,
          "document_end": 1279,
          "text": "扭杆：受扭转作用时，可产生扭转变形，以便吸收车轮与地面碰撞时的冲击能量。",
          "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89",
          "start": 1243,
          "end": 1279,
          "chunk_start": 1243,
          "chunk_end": 1279,
          "sentence_document_start": 1243,
          "sentence_document_end": 1279,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9246ac79ea2c83c280ea",
          "document_start": 1279,
          "document_end": 1305,
          "text": "它装在半轴内，内端有41条刻纹与半轴内端的刻纹啮合；",
          "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89",
          "start": 1279,
          "end": 1305,
          "chunk_start": 1279,
          "chunk_end": 1305,
          "sentence_document_start": 1279,
          "sentence_document_end": 1305,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_21e2540696408031933c",
          "document_start": 1305,
          "document_end": 1324,
          "text": "外端有40条刻纹，与扭杆盖的刻纹啮合。",
          "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89",
          "start": 1305,
          "end": 1324,
          "chunk_start": 1305,
          "chunk_end": 1324,
          "sentence_document_start": 1305,
          "sentence_document_end": 1324,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_de630faf35d2b2a1749a",
          "document_start": 1324,
          "document_end": 1334,
          "text": "扭杆盖固定在曲臂上。",
          "section_id": "section_d3ec99cb7d89",
          "start": 1324,
          "end": 1334,
          "chunk_start": 1324,
          "chunk_end": 1334,
          "sentence_document_start": 1324,
